---
layout: base.njk
title: "Find agent skills that actually work in your agent"
desc: "Skills, plugins and MCP servers checked against official docs for Claude Code, Codex, Grok Build, Cursor and Pi, with the exact install command for each."
---
{% from "macros.njk" import card, pill %}
{% set demo = skills | where("slug","sentry") %}{% set demo = demo[0] or skills[0] %}
<section class="hero wrap">
 <div class="hl">
  <span class="eyebrow"><i class="live"></i>Checked against official docs · {{ site.checked }}</span>
  <h1>Find agent skills that actually work in <em>your</em> agent.</h1>
  <p class="sub">{{ site.tagline }}</p>
  <div class="picker" role="radiogroup" aria-label="I use"><span class="pl">I use:</span>
   {% for a in site.agents %}<button type="button" role="radio" class="ag" data-agent="{{ a }}" aria-checked="false"><i class="ad" style="--c:{{ site.agentColor[a] }}"></i>{{ a|agentName }}</button>{% endfor %}</div>
  <label class="bigsearch"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="m20 20-3.5-3.5"/></svg>
   <input id="q" type="search" placeholder="Search {{ skills.length }} skills, e.g. database, browser, deploy…" aria-label="Search skills"><kbd>/</kbd></label>
 </div>
 <div class="hr" aria-hidden="true"><div class="demo">
  <div class="ch"><span class="mono">{{ demo.mono }}</span><div class="cn"><h3>{{ demo.name }}</h3><span class="meta2">{{ demo.typeLabel }} · {{ demo.catLabel }}</span></div></div>
  <p>{{ demo.description | truncate(90) }}</p>
  <div class="dtabs">{% for a in site.agents %}<span data-a="{{ a }}" class="{{ demo.compatibility[a] }}">{{ a|agentName }}</span>{% endfor %}</div>
  <div class="dcode"><span class="pr">$</span><code id="dcode"></code></div>
  <div class="dst" id="dst"></div>
  <script type="application/json" id="demodata">{{ {install:demo.install, compat:demo.compatibility} | json | safe }}</script>
 </div></div>
</section>
<section class="wrap stats">
 <div><b>{{ skills.length }}</b><span>skills & MCP servers</span></div><div><b>5</b><span>coding agents</span></div>
 <div><b>{{ skills | sumDocs }}</b><span>install methods verified from docs</span></div><div><b>4</b><span>official marketplaces + npm</span></div>
</section>
<section class="wrap how">
 <h2 class="sh">How it works</h2>
 <ol><li><span>1</span><h3>Pick your agent</h3><p>Choose Claude Code, Codex, Grok Build, Cursor or Pi. The whole site adjusts to it.</p></li>
 <li><span>2</span><h3>Find a skill</h3><p>Search or filter by category, type and status. Each listing links back to its official source.</p></li>
 <li><span>3</span><h3>Copy the right command</h3><p>Get the install command from that agent's official docs. If there are no docs yet, we say so.</p></li></ol>
 <p class="muted">Honest labels: <span class="st documented">✓ Verified from docs</span> means an official source publishes the install method. <span class="st unknown">Not yet tested</span> means no official per-agent docs yet. We haven't run hands-on install tests. <a href="/how-it-works/">Full methodology →</a></p>
</section>
<section class="wrap">
 <div class="rowh"><h2 class="sh">Featured</h2><span class="muted">In 3 or more official marketplaces</span></div>
 <div class="hrow">{% set n = 0 %}{% for s in skills %}{% if s.featured and n < 7 %}{% set n = n + 1 %}{{ card(s) }}{% if n == 2 %}<article class="card sponsor"><div class="ch"><span class="mono">+</span><div class="cn"><h3>Your skill here</h3><span class="meta2">Sponsored slot · 1 per row</span></div><span class="spon">Sponsored</span></div><p>Reach developers while they're choosing what to install. Always labeled, and never changes a status.</p><a class="btn ghost" href="/advertise/">Advertise →</a></article>{% endif %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div>
</section>
<section class="wrap browse" id="browse">
 <div class="rowh"><h2 class="sh">Browse</h2><button class="btn ghost fbtn" type="button" id="fopen">Filters</button></div>
 <div class="bl">
 <aside class="facets" id="facets"><div class="fh"><b>Filters</b><button type="button" id="fclose" aria-label="Close filters">✕</button></div>
  <fieldset><legend>Works in</legend><select id="agent" aria-label="Agent"><option value="">Any agent</option>{% for a in site.agents %}<option value="{{ a }}">{{ a|agentName }}</option>{% endfor %}</select></fieldset>
  <fieldset><legend>Status (for chosen agent)</legend><label><input type="radio" name="st" value="" checked> All</label><label><input type="radio" name="st" value="documented"> Verified from docs</label><label><input type="radio" name="st" value="unknown"> Not yet tested</label></fieldset>
  <fieldset><legend>Type</legend>{% for t in skills|pluck("type")|uniq %}<label><input type="checkbox" name="type" value="{{ t }}"> {{ (skills|where("type",t))[0].typeLabel }} <em>{{ (skills|where("type",t)).length }}</em></label>{% endfor %}</fieldset>
  <fieldset><legend>Category</legend><select id="cat" aria-label="Category"><option value="">All categories</option>{% for c in skills|pluck("category")|uniq|sort %}<option value="{{ c }}">{{ c }} ({{ (skills|where("category",c)).length }})</option>{% endfor %}</select></fieldset>
  <button type="button" class="btn ghost" id="freset">Reset filters</button>
 </aside>
 <div class="results">
  <div class="rbar"><p class="count" aria-live="polite"><b id="n">{{ skills.length }}</b> results</p><label class="sort">Sort <select id="sort"><option value="compat">Most compatible</option><option value="az">A–Z</option></select></label></div>
  <div class="grid" id="grid">{% for s in skills %}{{ card(s) }}{% endfor %}</div>
  <div class="empty" id="empty" hidden><h3>No matches</h3><p>Try a broader search, a different agent, or a popular category: <a href="?cat=database#browse">database</a>, <a href="?cat=deployment#browse">deployment</a>, <a href="?cat=monitoring#browse">monitoring</a>.</p><a class="btn ghost" href="/submit/">Submit this skill →</a></div>
  <button class="btn ghost more" id="more" type="button">Load more</button>
 </div></div>
</section>
<section class="wrap teaser"><div class="rowh"><h2 class="sh">Compatibility at a glance</h2><a href="/matrix/">Full matrix →</a></div>
 <div class="heat">{% for a in site.agents %}{% set c = 0 %}{% for s in skills %}{% if s.compatibility[a]=='documented' %}{% set c = c + 1 %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
 <div class="hrow2"><span class="hn"><i class="ad" style="--c:{{ site.agentColor[a] }}"></i>{{ a|agentName }}</span><div class="bar"><i style="width:{{ (c/skills.length*100)|round(1) }}%"></i></div><span class="hc">{{ c }} / {{ skills.length }} verified from docs</span></div>{% endfor %}</div>
</section>
<section class="wrap" id="newsletter"><div class="news"><div><h2>SkillMaxx Weekly</h2><p>New skills, plugins and MCP servers across all 5 agents, plus whatever changed in the official docs. Every Tuesday.</p></div>
 <form id="nform"><input type="email" required placeholder="you@example.com" aria-label="Email"><button class="btn" type="submit">Join the waitlist</button><p class="muted" id="nmsg" hidden>Thanks! The newsletter isn't live yet, so nothing was saved or sent.</p></form></div></section>
